* Increase the market and promote the export of Cambodian products through trade promotion activities such as participation in world and international exhibitions, the establishment of trade centers and foreign trade representatives, etc.
* International trade cooperation has increased through bilateral and multilateral relations work.
* The private sector is growing through domestic business development, training and capacity building, entrepreneurship and producers.
* Control the quality and safety of goods through the inspection of goods, import and export and the suppression of counterfeiting (Camcontrol)
* Control inflation and maintain commodity price stability by monitoring and cooperating with the private sector and relevant ministries and institutions.
