Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that win-win politics has brought seven main benefits, including:
1) The armed war is over and no longer exists in Cambodia.
2) The end of the war in the areas ruled by the former Khmer Rouge from the beginning of 1996 to the end of 1998 was the absence of weapons and the death of bullets.
3) Make Cambodia achieve national unity and peace like never before in the last 500 years in history and achieve development in all areas.
4) People who live near the battlefield and the hot battlefield are no longer worried about the war and no longer worry about living apart between husband and wife and children.
5) Make Cambodia move from a poor country to a low middle income country and to a high middle income country by 2030 and to a high income country by 2050. .
