Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this win-win policy, if there is only an idea and no operator, can not be successful. At this point, Samdech Samdao to all the people who have participated in the operation until the politics of victory, victory, success. Samdech Techo Hun Sen considered Samdech Tea Banh as his lieutenant in implementing both win-win politics and other important national affairs.
