In addition, and strive to develop the unit well to achieve the goals, strategic plans of the General Department of Prisons and the plan of the unit to be worthy of the trust of the Ministry of Interior and the Capital Hall.
Raksmey Phnom Penh Express bus kills elderly man while crossing the road
(Phnom Penh): A Cambodian-Muslim man was crossing the road on a bicycle when he was hit by a bus of Rasmei Phnom Penh Express Company, causing his immediate death at the scene.
The accident happened at 12:30 on December 28, 2018, along National Road 5 in Duong Village, Sangkat Prek Pnov, Khan Prek Pnov, Phnom Penh.
The victim is Leap Mat, 75 years old, a fisherman living along National Road 5 in Duong Village, Sangkat Prek Pnov, Khan Prek Pnov, Phnom Penh. The perpetrator was not identified.
Witnesses at the scene told Fresh News that prior to the incident, the victim had left his home on a bicycle to go to church, traveling from east to west. While the victim was crossing the road, suddenly, a bus of Rasmei Phnom Penh Express Company overtook another bus of unknown brand, oversteered and hit the victim completely, causing death. Life immediately on the scene.
After the accident, the car drove away from the scene about 100 meters, then the car stopped and the driver escaped. This is according to the same source.
After the incident, the Khan specialized force arrived at the scene and contacted the Phnom Penh Municipal Police Traffic Police to measure the vehicle and take it to the office to wait for a legal settlement. The bodies of the victims were handed over to their families for traditional rites at their homes.
