The workers that Samdech Techo Hun Sen met today from 15 factories in Kandal province are about 10,632 workers and from 7 provinces in Kampong Speu province, there are about 4,974 workers.
Minister Ith Sam Heng said that the above achievements are the success of the policy of attracting investment, the deployment of factories to the provinces, the national policy on employment and employment, the policy of industrial development in Cambodia, the policy on education and training. Technical and professional and national policy framework for social protection of the Royal Government.
Please note that Samdech Techo Hun Sen has set out to meet with workers since August 20, 2017. To date, Samdech Techo Prime Minister has met with a total of 61 workers, with a total of 875,173 workers.
