Please be informed that the construction of this win-win monument started in February 2016 with an area of 8 hectares in Chroy Changva district, Phnom Penh, as a symbol of the peace that Cambodia has achieved after the end of decades of civil war. . In addition, this monument will be a legacy for future generations.
