Another “Five-Star Flower” Luxury Hotel Appears in Siem Reap to Meet Tourist Growth
(Siem Reap): A luxury boutique hotel with 24 rooms has been open since December 2018 to meet the growing number of tourists visiting Angkor Wat and other temples.
For this reason, local investors have initiated the creation of this additional luxury hotel, which has unique and unique features, combining ancient and modern architecture, making guests feel special and memorable. .
Each room is unique, with four separate buildings connected by a bridge around a swimming pool. Each room overlooks a large swimming pool, a saltwater pool that does not affect skin health. With health, safety and environmental considerations in mind, this hotel will provide a green feeling like no other.
The ground floor room has an outdoor soaking pool surrounded by natural greenery, guests can enjoy a wonderful refreshing dip in the warm sandstone pool.
Apart from the great architecture, each room is fully equipped and decorated. The hotel's customer service is provided by well-trained and smiling staff.
"Phka Chan" is the name of this new luxury hotel, named after the flowers of Cambodia. Almonds have been used by Cambodians everywhere since ancient times. This time, the "almond flower" has re-emerged uniquely at this luxury hotel.
According to the hotel manager, who has more than 10 years of experience in the five-star hotel industry, this new hotel will provide another new prestige for Siem Reap with potential tourism. The hotel is located about 600 meters from the night market and Pub Street, which is full of national and international guests will never miss arriving in Siem Reap.
The hotel's services include swimming pool, spa, gym, restaurant with international cuisine, packages to visit various temples and Siem Reap.
If you are planning to go to Siem Reap during the holiday season at the end of this year, please do not hesitate to contact the hotel "Flower" immediately to get a reservation before the end of the room with room rates from $ 66 and up Two 5-star breakfast.
