(Phnom Penh): Lt. Gen. Di Phin, former advisor to Samdech Akka Moha Thamma Pothisal Chea Sim, former President of the Senate of Cambodia, passed away at 1:27 on December 23, 2018 at the age of 83 due to illness.
The body of Lt. Gen. Dipin was laid to rest at National Cemetery No. 16C2 (Borey Lolon), 1986 Street, Sangkat Phnom Penh Thmey, Khan Sen Sok, Phnom Penh.
The body of Lt. Gen. Dipin will march from his home to Wat Samrong Andet, Khan Sen Sok, Phnom Penh to celebrate the national and Buddhist cremation on December 27, 2018 at 14:30.
The news of the death is considered as a notice and respectfully invite all close relatives and friends to be informed and attend the funeral with kindness.
