Pursuant to Samdech Techo's above-mentioned recommendations, the Phnom Penh Capital Administration is cooperating with Electricite du Cambodge (EDC) to reduce the electricity consumption of all vendors in all markets in Phnom Penh to 740 Riels per kilowatt hour. From January 2019 onwards.
