* All citizens should respect the traffic law, do not drive under the influence of alcohol and stay away from drugs.
* For pregnant women, go to the health center regularly and take the medicine as often as your doctor advised.
* People should work hard to grow crops to boost the family economy and be more vigilant to the fire that may occur eventually.
