The accident caused a male friend who was sitting behind him to faint for a while before regaining consciousness. After the incident, both sides of the car crushed the victim and the trailer that touched the steering wheel of the motorcycle with the victim tried to drive away from the scene.
Two men on a motorcycle collided with the steering wheel of a tuk-tuk, causing the car to fall from behind, crushing the head, causing a sudden brain injury and another with minor injuries. Overnight on December 20, 2018, located along Street 217 in Sangkat Stung Meanchey 3, Khan Meanchey, Phnom Penh.
