Derivatives Knowledge Sharing Workshop of Golden FX Link Capital and the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia will contribute to the development of this sector.
(Phnom Penh): The derivative knowledge sharing workshop in 5 provinces of Golden FX Link Capital and the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia highlighted the growth and relentless development of this sector in Cambodia.
The workshop of Golden FX Link Capital and the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia was a resounding success after expanding its coverage to five provinces: Sihanoukville, Kampong Cham, Siem Reap, Banteay Meanchey and Battambang.
This 2018 Provincial Workshop is the first and foremost event of the Cambodian Derivatives Exchange and the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia held in the provinces and is a good initiative to further promote the derivatives market. All aspects, adding great value to the breadth of understanding of this market and creating a platform for human resource development, financial activity and economic status.
Mr. Sou Socheat expressed his commitment to promoting derivatives trading in all parts of Cambodia and to facilitate the growth of the legal market. In order to protect investors, the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia is working to make them aware of properly registered brokerage firms and encourage them to continue to implement risk management approaches and investor protection policies.
Mr. Sok Dara said that in the past three years, the derivatives market in Cambodia has grown significantly in terms of trading volume, number of players in the market and regulations.
"Every investment is risky, and the higher the risk, the greater the return, and the diversification of investment is an important strategy to reduce risk," he added.
Mr. Sieng Thirith also encouraged the participants to seek knowledge and skills of derivatives trading and select a legitimate and professional derivatives broker as their investment partner for the security of their capital and asset accumulation.
Golden FX Link Capital Company participated in all the workshops in these 5 provinces. While the company has organized various knowledge-related events attended by national and international financial experts to educate the Cambodian public.
Hosea Poon expressed his pride in these achievements: "Everyone at Golden FX Link Capital, including me, is very pleased to share my knowledge and experience with the participants in these provincial workshops. Wherever they are, Cambodian investors will receive investment education as well as demonstrations and support to better seize investment opportunities.
