On December 16, 2018, a team from the Secretariat for the Elimination of Counterfeit Medicines and Illegal Health Services led by Dr. Vorn Vina, Deputy Director of the Provincial Health Department, visited the morgue and the clinic to gather information on the death. On the morning of December 19, 2018, the Department of Health cooperated with the prosecutor of the provincial court and local authorities to close the clinic.
