Lt. Nuon Sakhorn, a former A3 (combat police) officer, later a 61-year-old Kampong Thom provincial police officer, joined the police force in 1988 and was announced by the Ministry of Interior to retire in 2014.
Nuon Sakhorn is married to Sorya, 64, has four children and two young grandchildren. At present, he has no occupation other than the monthly salary provided by the Royal Government, as they are both physically ill and unable to do any business.
