(Preah Vihear): Mr. Hor Bun Hour, Governor of Rovieng District, Preah Vihear Province and Chairman of the District Unity Command, on December 15, 2018, led the three Armed Forces and relevant professional officers to crack down on illegal gold mining activities. And use chemicals at Prey Toteung in Trapeang Tontum village, Romtom commune, Rovieng district, Preah Vihear province.
Rovieng District Governor told Fresh News this afternoon that on behalf of the District Unity Command, he led a working group with the participation of the three armed forces and relevant officials to crack down on the case. Illegal gold mining business and use of chemicals in the above points.
