(Phnom Penh): Under the roof of the same house, which used to be full of warmth, happiness, laughter, happiness, the reunion between mother, father and children suddenly turned into silence and only sorrow because the wandering will never return Of father and mother, who are rich and dear, full of heart because of a serious anger for a while.
At around 8 pm on December 13, 2018, the sound of four bullets repeatedly fired by the father on the mother and then killed himself, leaving two sons and daughters alone, helpless. And find the island, find the shore not found. The father raised his hand to attack the mother like this because the father was angry with the mother because the love bond is no longer the same as before.
This anger immediately turned their two sons and daughters into orphans and changed their lives. Can anyone hold back the tears when their parents are so far away that they will never go back, leaving only memories of the past?
All these sorrows also formed a letter that appeared in the hearts of both of them, full of pity and posted on Facebook, with the participation of condolences and messages of encouragement for the struggle of network users. Society offers them both.
The son of the victim, who died in the case of a husband shooting his wife and then shooting himself in the back due to jealousy in Stung Sen City, Kampong Thom Province, posted a series of messages on Facebook describing his regrets and condolences to both of you. Two without a day will go back.
One of the messages he posted on Facebook was also shared, with a mix of condolences and encouragement from social media users, so that the two of them could work together. Strive for the future, even if your parents die.
After all, this case is also a lesson for everyone, especially for the head of the family, because anger, when not thinking long and hard, can change the family situation and divorce will never return and full of remorse for life. As the old saying goes, "angry is wrong, angry is corrupt, angry is not profitable." It is also a lesson for everyone to control their anger, because when released, there is no good return.
