After inspecting the organic vegetable farm, the Minister and his colleagues continued to inspect the cattle and pig farm of farmer Kao Bunty in Teuk Pong village, Boeung Treav commune, Sre Ambel district, Koh Kong province. Currently, the farm raises 80 beef cattle and has cooperated with CP Cambodia to raise 560 beef pigs on more than 30 hectares.
