Samsung launches air conditioning repair and installation training for professional trainees from 6 provinces
(Phnom Penh): Samsung has opened a training course on air conditioning repair and installation from December 11 to December 28, 2018 to 350 professional trainees with professional participants. From 6 different provinces: Kampong Cham, Battambang, Banteay Meanchey, Sihanoukville, Siem Reap and Phnom Penh.
The 17-day air conditioning repair and installation training program features both theoretical and practical training with Samsung electronics, trained by Samsung's own instructors. This skills training course has three main goals:
1: Training on air conditioning and air conditioning system installation skills with the highest confidence for customers
2: Building trust and confidence in the use of Samsung electronics that provide easy installation and repair.
3: Enhancing new knowledge, more comprehensive and advanced skills for installation on Samsung air conditioners, so after completing this training on electronics skills, participants will gain a lot of knowledge that helps them Easier to provide the best quality, fast and highly reliable service for Samsung customers.
