Mr. Christian René Baggetto expressed his deep gratitude to the President of the Senate for taking the time to allow him to pay a courtesy call at this time.
At the same time, he informed the President of the Senate that he was honored by His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of Cambodia, to visit and present Satan on the morning of December 11, 2018.
He expressed his pleasure to complete his diplomatic mission in Cambodia and hoped that in the future, the Senate of the Kingdom of Cambodia and the Senate of the Republic of Chile would have good relations and cooperation with each other, as well as exchange experiences. On the other hand, the legislative function, the representative function and the control function.
Christian Reagan Baggeto confirmed to the President of the Senate that on January 17-19, 2019, a delegation of 6 Chilean Parliamentarians will attend the Asia-Pacific Parliamentary Forum (APPF) in Siem Reap. Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum congratulated the Ambassador of the Republic of Chile on his appointment as Ambassador Extraordinary and Plenipotentiary of the Republic of Chile to the Kingdom of Cambodia.
The President of the Senate is confident that his diplomatic mission in the Kingdom of Cambodia will contribute to the strengthening and expansion of the friendship and cooperation between the people and the legislatures of the two countries, both now and in the future. .
The President of the Senate stated that Cambodia has potential in the field of tourism and natural resources. Samdech hopes that through the Ambassador will encourage more investors and tourists to invest and visit Cambodia.
The President of the Senate announced his readiness to cooperate well with the Ambassador to contribute to the strengthening and expansion of relations and cooperation between the people of the two countries now and in the future. In that regard, the President of the Senate wants to have good relations between the legislatures of the two countries through the exchange of experiences between MPs and parliamentary officials of the two countries.
