Tbong Khmum Provincial Authority launches environmental clean-up campaign around the provincial administration to inspire people to take care of and love the environment
The above campaign to promote environmental sanitation was held on December 11, 2018, led by Mr. Cheam Chansophoan, Governor of Tbong Khmum, with the participation of Deputy Governors, leaders of departments / units around the province and students from universities. Heng Samrin Tbong Khmum, a total of more than 500 people.
Mr. Cheam Chansophoan said that participation in promoting hygiene and the environment in the community is very important, especially the collection of garbage in schools, at home, on public roads, as well as resorts and other places. He said that a lot of garbage and waste can be a source of disease and affect human health, animals and plant growth.
