Pailin Constituency Deputies Open a Groundbreaking Ceremony for a Road in Sala Krao District
(Pailin): In response to the request of the people on the morning of December 11, 2018, Ms. Ban Srey Mom, Member of Parliament for Pailin Constituency and her team opened the construction site of a 2,800-meter road in Ochheukrom village, commune. Stung Karch, Sala Krao district, Pailin province, borders Cambodia-Thailand, which has suffered for many years.
