(Hanoi, Vietnam): After a one-day official visit on the night of December 7, 2018, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and the delegation were organized by the Prime Minister of Vietnam, Mr. Nguyen Suon Phuc. The ceremony was very lavish and very warm.
