Historical poetic spectacle "Angkor Empire" officially opened
(Siem Reap): An important cultural project "One Road, One Belt" and the Cambodia-China Cultural Tourism Cooperation Project officially launched for the first time a large historical poetic spectacle "Angkor Empire" on the afternoon of the 6th December 2018.
"Over the years, relations between the two countries have grown significantly, especially in the fields of economy, politics, culture, tradition and other fields."
Oknha Pung Kheav Se said, "The theater is an important cultural and tourism center that focuses on performance and has improved Siem Reap, and is a new tourism project in Cambodia."
The tycoon confirmed that the successful investment of the "Angkor Empire" project has made the work efficient, with good results, especially in the future, there will be more Chinese companies to invest and build in Cambodia.
The project is located in Siem Reap, Cambodia, just 5 km from Angkor Wat, one of the Seven Famous Wonders of the World, the only place in Siem Reap to be traversed first. Will reach Angkor Wat.
Among the scenes of the performance of "Angkor Empire" is part of the art of cultural exchange, tradition and cooperation between Cambodia and China, this is China's first "One Belt One Road" cultural implementation project. Who reached the outer territory.
This gallery brings together the literature, art, culture and traditions between Cambodia and China, aerobics, dance, music, stage decoration, costumes, stage equipment, etc., as well as the performance spirit of the performing arts group becomes more attractive and improved.
The 6,000-square-meter Angkor Theater can accommodate more than 1,300 spectators at a time, which is currently the largest performing theater in Cambodia and Southeast Asia and meets international standards.
Around the main festival, there are plans to set up a 2,000-square-meter art exhibition center for art training and a 1,500-square-meter educational base to highlight the cultural and artistic attraction between Cambodia and China.
4,000 square meters is a restaurant that can accommodate thousands of people at a time for guests to dine and enjoy professional art performances and a rich and well-structured entertainment venue. For national and international tourists from all over the world to enjoy.
Zhou xiaoheng, general manager of Kaheng International, said the project was the first permanent project of the "One Belt One Road" international cooperation project. It is also an important forum for Sichuan to promote cultural development in Cambodia and Southeast Asia, now the most modern performing arts festival in Southeast Asia.
Xi Jinping Meets with North Korean Foreign Minister as North Korea-US Nuclear Talks Stalled
BEIJING: Chinese President Xi Jinping met with North Korean Foreign Minister Ryeong-ho in Beijing on Friday as nuclear disarmament talks on the Korean Peninsula between Pyongyang and Washington stalled. Crash. This was released by the Chinese news agency Xinhua on Friday evening, December 7, 2018.
