Nationwide Traffic Law Enforcement Campaign, December 7: 732 illegal vehicles found and 467 fined
(Phnom Penh): The nationwide traffic law enforcement campaign for December 7, 2018, the traffic police force inspected 3,368 vehicles and found 732 vehicles violating the law (72% motorcycles), 265 education vehicles and 467 fines. This is according to the official report of the Traffic Police and Public Order Department of the General Commission of the National Police.
