Cambodian Ambassador to Indonesia: The Foundations of Cambodia's Development Remain Stable and Excellence in All Areas Due to Democratic Leadership
(Bali-Indonesia): Hor Nambora, Cambodian Ambassador Extraordinary and Plenipotentiary to the Republic of Indonesia, stated that the foundations of Cambodia's economic development continue to be stable and superior in all areas, it can be achieved due to the leadership Democratic style. This was stated by the Cambodian Ambassador to Indonesia at the 11th Bali Democracy Forum, which took place from 6 to 7 December 2018 in Indonesia.
Mr. Hor Nambora stated that "the macro- and micro-fundamentals of Cambodia's economic market development continue to be stable and superior in all areas, which is achievable due to the democratic leadership that has been established. "Socio-economic development that is more open, transparent and sustainable to achieve prosperity for the people."
Mr. Hor Nambora said that Cambodia was very happy to actively participate in the launch as well as in the activities of the 11th Bali Democracy Forum. He said the theme for the 11th forum was "Democracy for Prosperity" and that the two main sub-topics were: "Sustaining Democracy and Prosperity and the Environment" and "Technology, Innovation and the Future." Of prosperity.
According to the Cambodian Ambassador to Indonesia, for the Kingdom of Cambodia, both sub-topics can be considered as important foundations in the current strategic goals of the Royal Government of Cambodia. In fact, decades ago, Cambodia incorporated these points into the country's development work, focusing on economic integrity, innovation, equity and sustainability.
He stressed that Cambodia will not provide the definition of democracy as defined in the Western context, but instead acknowledge our full understanding of the definition of the term. The most appropriate thing is for Cambodia to exercise democratic rule in its own way towards prosperity.
Mr. Hor Nambora emphasized that for Cambodia, a prosperous, democratic democracy means that a cultural value is determined by the unity of the Cambodian people, which brings about vibrant relations and cooperation under the goal of eradicating poverty. Protect the environment and to ensure the peace and prosperity of the people.
