Golden FX Link Capital Co., Ltd. Participates in the Promotion of "Derivatives Trading" with the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia in the Provinces
As of December 05, 2018, 3 provinces, including Sihanoukville, Kampong Cham and Siem Reap, where the Securities and Exchange Commission and Kolden FX Link Capital Company held a seminar to promote this new type of trading. The other two provinces where the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia and Koulden FX Link Capital will continue to promote are Banteay Meanchey and Battambang.
The derivatives trading seminar in these provinces aims to promote and expand the understanding of investing in derivatives in Cambodia, increase investor confidence and provide investors with the skills for this investment.
Through the seminar, Mr. Sok Dara, Deputy Director General of the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia, introduced the derivatives as well as clarified the duties of the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia in promoting derivatives trading and facilitating growth. Of the legal derivatives market everywhere in Cambodia.
Mr. Yun Sovannara, Deputy Director of the Bureau of Business Management, Derivatives Investment and Derivatives Business of the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia, gave an overview of the derivatives market, the development of derivatives trading in Cambodia, the regulatory framework, the ongoing challenges and the strategic plan. Of the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia to further promote the derivatives sector.
Golden FX Link Capital is the only brokerage firm participating in the SEC's provincial workshop objectives this year. Due to the company's tenacity in pioneering the Cambodian financial market in line with international standards, Golden FX Link Capital has truly reflected its professionalism and set an example for other derivatives companies.
Hosea Poon, Chief Financial Officer of Golden FX Link Capital, stated that raising awareness of trading in public financial instruments is at the top of Golden FX Link Capital's priority list.
"The derivatives market in Cambodia continues to grow and reach its full potential," Poon added. "Many brokers are licensed, so the development of the derivatives market in Cambodia will be faster."
With the success of the seminars in Sihanoukville, Kampong Cham and Siem Reap, the future of the derivatives sector in Cambodia is expected to be brighter.
