(Phnom Penh): A woman hanged herself at the first floor of the Depot Market in her clothing store without knowing that the woman was in crisis. This incident surprised on the morning of December 6, 2018 in the Depot Market, 1st floor, Sangkat Phsar Depot 1, Khan Toul Kork, Phnom Penh.
According to the authorities, the victim was named Svay Sophal, 63 years old, a trader at Depot Market, living at 156 E1, Street 182 in Sangkat Phsar Depot 1, Khan Toul Kork, Phnom Penh.
According to local sources, the woman opened her shop every morning as usual. Later, at the time of the incident, her daughter came up but could not find her and asked. Take you nearby. His daughter later questioned the vendor and walked into the stall again, only to find the woman hanging herself with a scarf.
A vendor near the scene said that yesterday the woman complained that she was upset because of a family crisis. On December 6, 2018, at the time of the incident, the woman was found hanged.
Later, the security at the Depot Market reported to the local police to come down to the scene to perform an autopsy on the victim. After an autopsy, the police confirmed that the woman committed suicide by hanging herself. Meanwhile, the body was handed over to the family for the traditional ceremony.
