National Workshop on Cambodia Emergency Response Exercise 2018 Held in Battambang
(Battambang): This morning, December 6, 2018, Battambang Provincial Administration organized a National Workshop on Cambodia Emergency Response Exercise 2018 (KAMREX) to strengthen the response capacity of the Disaster Management Committee. At the national and provincial levels, to improve disaster preparedness and response planning through structured communication.
Mr. Nguon Rattanak, Provincial Governor and Chairman of the Provincial Disaster Management Committee, spoke in support of and closely cooperated with the Secretary General of the NCDD in organizing the invitation of the members of the Provincial Disaster Management Committee and the provincial Red Cross officials. Facilitate a two-day test drive venue.
