The purpose of the meeting is to introduce the project background and guide the team for good cooperation, determine the scope of work and time of data collection, relevant and preliminary analysis, discuss some urgent requests and work to make the project a feasibility study and The master plan for the sewage network and drainage system in Siem Reap started smoothly and successfully.
