It should also be noted that in recent years, the Royal Government of Cambodia is very concerned about the problem of wastewater in urban areas and has focused on finding solutions and strategies for water management. This pollution is effective by requesting the cooperation of all stakeholders, including the public sector and private development partners, national and international organizations.
