In particular, Mr. Zhou Sokary, President of the Cambodian-American Basketball Association, said that through cooperation on the above memorandum of understanding, he was committed to help develop Cambodian basketball to success in 2023. He claims that today the Basketball Association of America has a lot of resources for players who are working in basketball clubs in some states of the United States.
