The meeting of the Standing Committee of the National Assembly was chaired by Samdech Heng Samrin, President of the National Assembly, with the participation of all members of the Standing Committee.
In addition to the agenda for reviewing the proposed law on amendments to the law on political parties, today the National Assembly will also review the proposal to approve the draft law on public administration. The draft law has been submitted to the National Assembly for the fourth commission to study.
