Mr. Van Puthipol stated that this workshop was organized in order to disseminate to the companies-enterprises to understand the procedures and methods of income and expenditure distribution among related persons in accordance with the principles, guidelines and tax regulations, avoiding Transfer transactions that do not reflect the actual market value, as well as promote the progress of new tax regulations.
