To celebrate the 20th Cambodia Day of Persons with Disabilities and the 36th International Day of Persons with Disabilities 2018, the Royal Government would like to introduce the following:
* First, the 20th Cambodian Day of Persons with Disabilities and the 36th International Day of Persons with Disabilities shall be celebrated under the theme "Promoting the Rights of Persons with Disabilities, Ensuring Environment and Equality".
* Second, the Ministry of Information must cooperate with the Council of Disabled Activists to guide the public and private media to disseminate to the whole society to understand the history of the Day of Persons with Disabilities in Cambodia and the International Day of Persons with Disabilities on December 3.
* Third: All ministries, institutions, capitals and provinces must organize a ceremony to buy and meet with people with disabilities, entertainment programs for people with disabilities in ministries, institutions, capitals and provinces, public and private educational institutions, non-governmental organizations and all local districts. Body.
