Siem Reap City Authority and Samdech Techo Hun Sen Doeum Kralanh Market Management Committee Show Ambition to Make the Market a "Model Market"
(Siem Reap): After Samdech Techo Hun Sen Doeum Kralanh Market was built and almost completed, from the beginning of December 2018, the local authority of Siem Reap City, traders and the market management committee have shown their ambition to become this market. Instead, it is a "model market". Samdech Techo Hun Sen Doeum Kralanh Market is located in Sangkat Kork Chak, Siem Reap City, Siem Reap Province.
Mr. Pov Saravuth, Deputy Governor of Siem Reap City, said that the situation was changed after the introduction of public clean-up on the temporary stalls in front of the market, the streets around the market and the main road in front of the market. Held from the morning of December 1 to 3, this year, the Siem Reap municipal authorities have called for the cooperation of business people and people living on the streets / roads around the market.
He said the call was for vendors at the temporary locations to enter their new location, which was agreed to draw lots on November 10. He also reminded that before the new construction, Doeum Kralanh Market was completely burnt down in the early morning on July 6, 2013.
Mr. Sok Toun, a representative of the Samdech Techo Hun Sen Engineering Corps in Siem Reap Province, who is in charge of the construction of Samdech Techo Hun Sen Deum Kralanh Market, said that he, together with the local authorities and the market management committee and traders, we intend to The market will be designated as a "model market" to ensure public order, safety, environment, good hygiene and avoid traffic jams.
