First, the participants in the conference did not have the right to propose or elect the party's acting chairman in accordance with the party's statute.
Second, according to the statute, he can be the acting chairman of the party only in the absence of the chairman, who must be transferred to one of the oldest vice presidents (Article 45 new of the statute). It is not possible for another person who has not been elected by the party congress to be the vice-chairman and then acting acting chairman.
