(Kampong Cham): Dr. Ma Chhoeun, Member of Parliament for Kampong Cham Constituency, Member of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party and Chairman of the Central Working Group for Choeung Prey District on December 2, 2018, said that without December 2, "Front "Cambodian National Salvation Unity" and without the win-win policy of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, there is no peace like today.
This statement was made on the occasion that Dr. Ma Chhoeun, Member of Parliament for Kampong Cham Constituency, presided over the celebration of the 40th Anniversary of the United Front for the Development of Motherland Cambodia, which was held at the CPP headquarters. Cheung Prey, Kampong Cham province, this morning, December 2, 2018.
