It should be noted that the "United Front for the Development of Motherland of Cambodia", originally known as the "United Front for the National Salvation of Cambodia", was established in the liberated area in Cheung Khlou village, 2 Thnou commune, Snuol district, Kratie province on December 2, 1978 to defeat The brutal overthrow of the Pol Pot regime led to a glorious victory on January 7, 1979, and the complete return of the regime for the second time.
