Samdech Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin said that the celebration of the 40th anniversary is in the spirit of always remembering the great merits of the cadres, fighters of the Cambodian National Salvation Front and the heroes of the Vietnamese Volunteer Army who sacrificed their lives. Fresh in the cause of fighting to overthrow the genocidal regime of Pol Pot.
Samdech reminded that the pure patriots of the Cambodian People's Party, who survived the massacre of the Pol Pot regime, stood up and fought bravely against the Khmer Rouge regime and together formed the "Kampuchean United Front for National Salvation". On December 2, 1978. With the timely support of the Vietnamese Volunteer Army, the 2 December Movement overthrew the genocidal regime of Pol Pot on January 7, 1979.
