Samdech Ponhea Chakrei added that the spirit of December 2, as well as the spirit of January 7, has always been inscribed in the conscience of all people and has become a great force in the creation of great achievements of the society. Under the light of peace, freedom and in the position of holding on to its own destiny, Cambodia believes that there will be no recurrence of tragedy as in the past.
Samdech Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin said, "We all always remember that December 2, 1978 was not only a day when Cambodia stepped out of tragedy and not only showed the spirit of self-sacrifice and unity of the resistance." "Only patriotism, but December 2, 1978 also became an important historical mirror for Cambodia to take as a lesson in leading the country not to fall into the historical abyss of hell again."
