(Phnom Penh): Cambodians all over the country know that Chip Mong is the lifeblood of the construction industry in Cambodia. The supply of quality construction products has been at the forefront since the 1980s.
To date, Chip Mong has used more than 30 years of experience in manufacturing and importing quality construction products to further refine the range of construction products to meet the needs of the Cambodian construction market, which is in need of quality construction products. .
At the same time, Chip Mong also introduced new construction products, concrete tiles and Chip Mong pipes made using the latest technology from Italy, with raw materials from Europe. Customers who visit the exhibition can also have the opportunity to receive special promotions and souvenirs from Chip Mong.
A young man who visited the Chip Mong booth said that the exhibition program was interesting because it provided a lot of information related to the development of the construction industry in the country, especially Chip Mong, a local company that has developed beyond growth. They build on quality construction products to match foreign products present in Cambodia.
He also said that the visit to the stand made him better aware of the technology of production, as well as the opportunity to register to visit the market.
