Mr. Kong Vibol confirmed that "there is no further delay for the payment of taxes on all means of transport and vehicles in 2018."
As of November 29, 2018, the tax payment has reached 90 percent, he said. He noted that in recent times, there has been a lot of rush to pay this tax by the partner banks of the Ministry of Economy and Finance, as well as tax branches in all provinces / Khans, with people coming to pay taxes on means of transportation. A lot.
Although the tax payment date for all types of vehicles and vehicles for 2018 is set to close on November 30, owners of all types of vehicles and vehicles can still pay this tax. According to the tax branches in all provinces, Khans and partner banks of the Ministry of Economy, with a fine of 100%, the tax will be doubled.
