(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Tourism has been preparing a new draft sub-decree on the establishment and management of sacred tourism sites and has submitted a meeting of the Tourism Development Committee for comments as well as additional inputs before submitting to the Royal Government for approval. On this new tourism product. This is according to Mr. Tith Chantha, Permanent Secretary of the Ministry of Tourism.
It should be noted that the Tourism Development Commission is headed by the Ministry of Tourism, which is currently implementing a comprehensive tourism infrastructure project in the Greater Mekong Subregion (GMS) with concessional financing by the Asian Development Bank (ADB).
The Secretary of State explained that this "sacred tourism site" refers to areas with potential for tourism in Cambodia, which are defined by the Royal Government of Cambodia. Each sacred tourist area is packed with the main fitness and tourism services such as accommodation, tourism, food and beverage services, recreation centers, tourist attractions, sports centers, parks, health care centers, tourism centers and other tourism-related centers or services.
He said that after passing and commenting on the Tourism Development and Editing Commission, the commission will send a new draft sub-decree on the establishment and management of this sacred tourism site to the Royal Government for approval.
Cambodia has a lot of potential for tourism development, combined with the opportunity to increase tourism, and according to Cambodia's vision is to want about 30 million national and international tourists by 2030. Therefore, in order to achieve this vision of tourism growth, an important factor that can not be missed is the introduction of new tourism products to receive both tourism growth and benefit from tourism.
He said that all areas with potential for tourism, both cultural and natural, have infrastructure, services, hotels, restaurants, restaurants, places that can create sports tourism, recreation centers, tourism health care centers are all that can be created as a sacred tourist area.
