(Italy): With the permission of the Royal Government, the Minister of Justice, Mr. Ang Vong Vathana, led a delegation of the Ministry of Justice to attend the World Summit on "Innocent World", which took place on 28-29 November. 2018 in Rome, Italy, with the participation of the Ministers of Justice of more than 30 countries.
During the meeting, Minister Ang Vong Vathana briefed the participants on the main meanings of the provisions, laws, substances and procedures of law enforcement in Cambodia related to punishment and execution.
The Minister highlighted the will of the Royal Government, which has Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, in protecting the property and freedoms of all citizens in accordance with the Constitution and the laws in force, and in leading Cambodia along the path of the rule of law.
The call was made on the occasion of Deputy Prime Minister Chea Sophara presiding over the 7th Annual General Assembly and the inauguration of the Cambodian Construction Industry Exhibition 2018 of the Cambodian Builders Association, held at the Koh Pichna Center. This morning, November 29, 2018.
Deputy Prime Minister Chea Sophara said that today's program is an opportunity for enterprises, companies, members of associations and many other national and international companies to come together to exchange ideas and share experiences and knowledge with each other.
He added that, in particular, to receive information about the activities and achievements that the association has achieved, as well as provide opportunities for customers who visit, developers and investors in the real estate sector, builders and sellers to meet directly to discuss the needs. And suppliers, etc.
Deputy Prime Minister Chea Sophara also stated, "I hope that our business people, both domestic and foreign, will take this opportunity (exhibition) to build partnerships."
At the same time, the Ministry of Land Management would like to encourage all professionals and business people in the construction industry, including: architects, engineers, consultants, construction managers, builders and real estate developers to comply with relevant laws and regulations. Proper construction sector to ensure the safety and quality of construction in Cambodia, such as:
* Must have a construction permit and a permit to open the site before construction and must comply with the approved technical plans and other technical regulations properly.
Business companies constructing and studying design projects, including a group of construction workers, must apply for registration as a business operator in accordance with the law in force.
* The construction site must be organized in an orderly and hygienic manner and all construction sites must not transport concrete, soil and construction materials to cause them to fall on public roads.
* All construction sites must be equipped with materials and equipment to protect the safety and health of all workers working in the construction site, etc.
Please be informed that the Cambodia Construction Industry Exhibition 2018 lasts for 3 days, from today until December 1, 2018, and there are 186 companies exhibiting various products, including 310 booths and More than 600 products, some local and some imported from around the world.
Dried trout with boracic substance for sale at Bek Chan market and Thnal Toteung market, Camcontrol branch officials in Kandal province confiscated and destroyed
(Kandal): Officials from CamControl Kandal Branch, in cooperation with Provincial Department of Commerce, on November 29, 2018, inspected the safety of food products displayed in the market and some shops around Bek Chan Market. And Thnal Toteung Market, Ang Snoul District, Kandal Province.
