National Chemical Authority Continues to Disseminate the Law on "Prohibition of Chemical Weapons, Nuclear Weapons, Biological Weapons and Radioactive Weapons" to Kampot Provincial Administration
(Kampot): Lt. Gen. Heng Vuthy, Deputy Secretary General of the National Chemical Authority of the Ministry of National Defense, on November 28, 2018, led the professional officers to continue disseminating the law on "Prohibition of chemical weapons, nuclear weapons, biological weapons and radioactive weapons" to Kampot Provincial Administration.
