Job opportunities from 55 big institutions and companies in Battambang Job Fair
This is the first time that the National Employment Agency has organized the largest employment event in Battambang with the aim of:
* Create a convenient one-stop meeting platform for employers, educators and job seekers to exchange and share labor market information
* Employers can advertise current and future recruitment needs to attract competent job seekers.
* Job seekers can apply for jobs on the spot and receive information about future job opportunities and skills development opportunities.
* Training and education providers can promote all kinds of curricula, courses and skills development programs
* Provide a platform for building human resource communication networks
As mentioned above, for students and the general public, especially those looking for a job, do not forget to prepare a resume (CV) to apply for a free live interview at the Institute of Technology Battambang along National Road. 5 Romchek Village 4, Sangkat Rattanak, Battambang City.
