In the third quarter, traffic accidents caused nearly 400 deaths and more than 1,000 injuries
(Phnom Penh): In the third quarter of 2018, there were 745 traffic accidents, resulting in 383 deaths and 1,028 injuries. Compared to the second quarter, the number of accidents decreased 69 times, equal to 8%. This is according to the report of the National Road Safety Committee.
(China): Financial institutions in China have launched new financial services based on micro-credit insurance to make it easier for small and medium-sized technology companies to obtain micro-loans and to help them. Can expand their business by spending less money.
After applying for a loan, small and medium-sized technology companies have to wait just one month to get a loan. Borrowing fees, on the other hand, are also less than 4 percent, much lower than regular borrowing fees.
Li Yi runs a private high-tech company selling agricultural products. However, it is difficult for his company to borrow money from the bank because it does not have enough collateral for the bank to provide loans.
"The $ 720,000 loan we borrowed from the Photong Development Bank of Shanghai helped solve our problem in a very timely manner," Li said. Later, we got another loan of $ 720,000. So, in total, we borrowed $ 1.4 million. "This money has enabled us to successfully promote our new technology and sell our quality agricultural products."
Kem Sokha's lawyer claims that Kem Sokha does not support Sam Rainsy's conference in early December
Kem Sokha's lawyer claims after former CNRP members abroad, apparently Sam Rainsy's group, announced that they would hold a major conference on December 1-2, 2018. In Atlanta, USA. At the same time, they also organized another public forum on December 15, 2018 with the participation of Mr. Sam Rainsy.
Following Mr. Sokha's statement that he did not support these activities, Mr. Rainsy's party accused Mr. Sokha's lawyer of making false claims and not Mr. Sokha's position.
Mr. Chan Chen did not comment on the criticism. He claims that what he said was true of his client and that as a lawyer, he was always professional and respected his client's will.
Rhinitis for a long time! Doctors claim it can lead to meningitis
(Phnom Penh): Dr. Ngo Ian Huyong, a professor of rhinosinology and esophagus from Cho Ray Hospital in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam, told reporters that if patients do not come for treatment in time, rhinitis can make you sick. The disease progresses to otitis media, otitis media, meningitis, strep throat, one of the deadliest diseases in the world.
The statement from the Vietnamese doctor was made during the free screening and treatment of rhinitis for 50 chiropractors at Choray Hospital in Phnom Penh on the morning of November 28. In 2018, in collaboration with the pharmaceutical company DHG Pharma, the collaboration between the two institutions will be conducted for up to 1,000 patients.
"If patients do not come for timely examination and treatment of rhinitis, the disease will progress to otitis media, otitis media, meningitis, and strep throat," said Dr. Ngu Ian Huyung, a professor of rhinology and esophagus. Original.
According to the doctor, the cause of rhinitis is caused by swollen nasal cells, nasal congestion, nasal congestion and inflammation of the nose is caused by many reasons, and also caused by dust, motorcycle smoke or Other combustion combined with the patient's activity, the environment is full of dust and odors, and can also be caused by weather factors.
The professor of esophagitis added that there are two types of rhinitis: first: normal rhinitis lasts for 2 weeks and second: allergic rhinitis lasts for 3 months. Go up.
After the previous free monthly screening and treatment program for this course, Cho Ray Phnom Penh Hospital in collaboration with DHG Pharma organized a free spine screening and treatment program for the first 50 new patients in one day. The collaboration will be held for up to 1,000 patients by a highly experienced Vietnamese specialist from Cho Rai Hospital in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam.
Please be informed that this free screening and treatment program for people with rhinitis is a meaningful humanitarian program of Choray Hospital Phnom Penh and DHG Pharma to contribute to the well-being of Cambodians. Opportunity to receive quality health care from highly experienced Vietnamese specialists along with modern medical equipment at Choray Hospital Phnom Penh.
At the same time, the doctor also advised on the treatment of two types of rhinitis, including:
1: Virus type is a problem of rhinitis, we can treat with a number of ways, such as: We need to be healthy, get plenty of rest combined with medication, and the other is to use nasal spray to treat this type of disease.
2. Allergies should be avoided if the patient's nose is not immune, if the patient encounters the same patient who has a cold or the paper should be kept away because it can lead to infection most easily and one. On the other hand, use nasal water.
Rhinoplasty Professor Dr. Ngo Ian Huyong from Cho Ray Hospital, Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam further confirmed that rhinitis is an inflammation of the nasal mucosa and can affect people of all ages, men, women and children. Or a girl.
