(Phnom Penh): 100 Million Riels was awarded to the winner from Echitan Green Tea Company on Mr. Meas Sophorn, 29 years old, born in Ponhea Krek District, Tbong Khmum Province. Room for rent in Ta Sek village, Sangkat Kampol, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh.
Mr. Meas Sophorn said that last week, after taking a break from riding a tricycle, he bought green tea with eucalyptus flavor and ate it, but when he turned the bottle cap, he saw a prize of 100 million riel in the bottle cap.
He said that he was immediately very excited and also showed to the sellers who are close to each other and contacted the company through the phone number on the bottle.
He said that currently the family life is very difficult because there is no business other than running a tricycle, which can earn only rent, and his wife is a factory worker. After receiving this award, he will take care of some of his livelihood and buy a car at a reasonable price to support his family in the future.
