About 1,000 hectares of rice in Kampong Svay district, Kampong Thom province affected by lack of water, the provincial governor intervened to pump water into rice fields
(Kampong Thom): Mr. Sok Lou, Governor of Kampong Thom Province, on November 26, 2018, led the intervention team to install water pumps to save about 1,200 hectares of dry rice in Prey Preah village, Chong Prey village, Tnot village and Tapong village, Kampong Svay commune, district. Kampong Svay, Kampong Thom province, which suffers from drought.
At the same time, Mr. Sok Lou and his team plan to install 6 large water pumps to pump water from Stung Sen to lakes and canals, which will enable people to continue pumping to save dry rice that is experiencing water shortage.
Mr. Sok Lou said that two large machines of the Ministry of Water Resources and Meteorology and another machine, sponsored by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, were pumping water to the main canal for people to continue pumping. For use, but still not enough, the provincial governor has ordered the Department of Water Resources to add three more heavy-duty machines to speed up the pumping of water to save dry rice in a timely manner.
Mr. Sok Lou stated that the main source of water for farmers in this area is Stung Sen water, but it is a bit far, and on the other hand, because Stung Sen water this year is too small to flow to other lakes, making the water source which is needed Use on farm work is not enough like in previous years. Therefore, the first solution is to pump Stung Sen water into various canals so that farmers can continue pumping to their respective fields.
Farmers are happy that the authorities as well as the provincial leaders have taken care to irrigate their rice in time because their paddy has just been watered for the first time and their paddy will continue to be watered. On the second or third time.
At the same time, the people also thanked the provincial authorities as well as Samdech Techo Hun Sen for helping to rescue their rice, which lacks water in time, and they will use this water not to waste and not make The leadership was not disappointed. All people, please continue to support the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
