(Kampong Thom): To facilitate farmers in this light rice harvest season, Mr. Sok Lou, Governor of Kampong Thom Province, on November 25, 2018, led the civil servants, the Armed Forces and the youth to help harvest rice in Prey Preah commune. Kampong Svay, Kampong Svay District, Kampong Thom Province and had a delicious meal in solidarity with the people in the rice fields, delicious and happy.
Mr. Sok Loo said that this is the rice harvest season, which each family is busy, while some families are forced to hire outside labor to help more. At this time, he led a team to help harvest rice in order to reduce the cost of farmers to hire labor to harvest rice that ripens in the field.
At the same time, Mr. Sok Lou expressed his happiness that Kampong Thom province can produce organic rice, with large companies signing contracts to buy rice for resale abroad at an affordable price.
In addition, he urged all farmers to produce rice in accordance with market demand and good quality so that the company can order more in the coming years. Therefore, let the people strive to grow more crops to improve the living standards of families, especially to maintain peace, political stability, do not believe in the incitement of some unscrupulous people.
Please note that in the season of harvesting light rice, Rumduol rice, some farmers are busy cultivating more hectares of dry rice.
