According to the results of the omen through the rain of candles to know the rain in all 25 provinces of the capital for the year of Kor Eksak, Buddhist era 2563, the year 2018 is the Queen Mother Kang Ken Baku, the Royal Palace said and informed:
1: Kandal Province: At the beginning and middle of the year, there is average rainfall, and at the end of the year, there is a lot of rainfall.
