(Mondulkiri): Due to the war in the country in the 1970s, the indigenous people in Dak Dam commune, Oreang district, Mondulkiri province fled to Vietnam for a while, then returned in 1986 Return home with both coffee and coffee growing knowledge and some other crops from Vietnam.
