Watch the full video of the interview with Tycoon Sea Rithy: Minister of Tourism: At least 60-70,000 guests a day can watch this year's Royal Water Festival
Minister Thong Khon made this statement after the meeting with the three water players of the Ministry of Tourism and Baray District who stayed at the boat factory in Chroy Changva district on the evening of November 20, 2018. .
He said that for international tourists, there are about 5,000 people a day, only those who visit the tourist forum on the river and there are more international tourists walking outside the forum. On the tour forum, they have a drink reception with multilingual translators.
He believes that there will be more national and international tourists to visit the Royal Water Festival than last year, because the Ministry of Tourism has been promoting more often, and the lives of the people have improved more than before.
In fact, the Royal Water Festival will be held on November 21-22-23, 2018, and the first stage will open tomorrow, in which Minister Thong Khon warned. I urge all athletes to consider health first, do not walk too much, lest there is not enough strength during the race.
He added that winning and losing the boat race is normal, but the most important thing is to join, unite, respect each other and participate in making people and tourists happy.
The minister said that all rowers must be disciplined, strictly in accordance with the regulations of the technical committee, must be hygienic in accommodation, avoid eating any food that leads to health, especially alcohol and drugs of all kinds. Meanwhile, the chef must cook enough food, good hygiene to nourish the players in his team to have a strong energy.
The Minister asked all players and participants to take care of public hygiene and the environment, do not throw garbage in the trash, and if you see garbage in bottles, cans or plastic, please pick it up and put it in the trash at City Hall. Prepared. We should gradually change our living habits so that Cambodia is full of clean and green and hygienic.
At the same time, Minister Thong Khon, as well as leaders and civil servants in the Ministry of Tourism, also distributed to the boat committee and the boat team a number of gifts, including: soy sauce, noodles, rice, clothes, hats, pure water, drinks and some budget. Also.
